    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't know if i can just \"rest\" in the way people mean. everything feels so heavy. like i've reached the end of the road and there's just a cliff there. it's strangely tempting, thinking about just... stepping off the treadmill for good. like, if the mission is accomplished and there's nothing left to gain, why keep dragging this around?",
